{"pageid":4911,"title":"Blue island","displaytitle":"<span class=\"mw-page-title-main\">Blue island</span>","revid":21088,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><table class=\"notice\" style=\"border-radius:15px; border:3px solid #FCBA03; background:#6e470c; font-size:90%; width:100%\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td width=\"10\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/44/Hexagon_Construction.png/revision/latest?cb=20250626004512\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Construction\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/44/Hexagon_Construction.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20250626004512\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Construction.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Construction.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</td>\n<td><p style=\"margin-bottom:.3em\"><span style=\"font-size:125%; font-weight:bold\">This page is under construction!</span><br />\n<span>This page is currently undergoing structural revisions. Please wait patiently until it is fully updated! You can help the Oaklands Wiki by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Blue_island?action=edit\">expanding it</a>.</span></p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><b>Blue island</b>, which is a placeholder for its actual name, is a sub-area, or collection of smaller islands behind the <a href=\"/wiki/Flowering_Meadows\" title=\"Flowering Meadows\">Flowering Meadows</a>. A variety of blue materials, native and not native reside in the area. Waterfalls that go in all directions, floating islands, sparkling blue water, alongside a new temple and cave are in this area.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/44/Hexagon_Location.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605040108\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Hexagon Location\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/4/44/Hexagon_Location.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/50?cb=20250605040108\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"50\" height=\"50\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Hexagon Location.png\" data-image-key=\"Hexagon_Location.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notable_Locations\">Notable Locations</span></h2>\n<ul><li>At the west of the area, there is a medium island shaped like a shooting star.</li>\n<li>In the east, is a splotch of islands, which range from a turquoise green, (for <a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Pine\" title=\"Blue Pine\">Blue Pine</a>) and blue (for <span class=\"new\" title=\"Blue wisteria (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmx1ZV93aXN0ZXJpYT9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Blue wisteria</span>).</li>\n<li>A underwater cave full of giant azurite clusters and new shrooms in the water</li>\n<li>The <a href=\"/wiki/Blizzard_Bloom\" title=\"Blizzard Bloom\">Blizzard Bloom</a> shine, essential for the <a href=\"/wiki/Petalfall\" title=\"Petalfall\">Petalfall</a></li></ul>\n<p>Both of these aren't connected to each other, but are connected closely to the <a href=\"/wiki/Flowering_Meadows\" title=\"Flowering Meadows\">Flowering Meadows</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Star_island\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest?cb=20250605041031\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Diamond Subtitle\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/b/bd/Diamond_Subtitle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/20?cb=20250605041031\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Diamond Subtitle.png\" data-image-key=\"Diamond_Subtitle.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <b>Star island</b></span></h3>\n<ul><li>Has 2 layers, the outermost layer, with <a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Pine\" title=\"Blue Pine\">Blue Pine</a> and the same turquoise green as the islands, and the inner layer with <span class=\"new\" title=\"Blue Wisterias (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvQmx1ZV9XaXN0ZXJpYXM/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Blue Wisterias</span>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902220742\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.012 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.018 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 24/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 607/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    2.043      1 Template:Under_Construction\n100.00%    2.043      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:4911-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902220742 and revision id 21088. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":[],"links":[{"title":"Blizzard Bloom","exists":true},{"title":"Blue Pine","exists":true},{"title":"Flowering Meadows","exists":true},{"title":"Petalfall","exists":true},{"title":"Blue wisteria","exists":false},{"title":"Blue Wisterias","exists":false}],"images":["Hexagon_Construction.png","Hexagon_Location.png","Diamond_Subtitle.png"]}
